1
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:42,950
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,460 --> 00:01:45,950
[Episode 16]

3
00:01:46,229 --> 00:01:47,470
I am more anxious.

4
00:01:48,150 --> 00:01:51,000
I wish I could rewrite the past.

5
00:01:51,350 --> 00:01:53,280
But the dead are gone,

6
00:01:54,950 --> 00:01:56,640
and nothing can be changed.

7
00:01:58,470 --> 00:02:01,680
I'm just a bit surprised why Lord Yan

8
00:02:01,950 --> 00:02:04,070
seems more anxious than I am.

9
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:07,870
It's as if you wanted me to believe it
immediately upon hearing,

10
00:02:07,870 --> 00:02:10,470
and punish the murderer right after.

11
00:02:10,870 --> 00:02:11,470
Isn't this

12
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:13,590
a bit hasty?

13
00:02:14,150 --> 00:02:15,800
But this also reminds me...

14
00:02:17,750 --> 00:02:20,070
Does the sudden appearance
of this maidservant

15
00:02:20,070 --> 00:02:23,800
involve any conspiracy behind the scenes?

16
00:02:24,190 --> 00:02:25,920
What exactly is the intention?

17
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:27,190
Lord Yan,

18
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:29,870
if in my private residence,

19
00:02:30,430 --> 00:02:32,120
I listen to a one-sided story,

20
00:02:32,470 --> 00:02:34,240
set up a private court,

21
00:02:34,870 --> 00:02:38,280
and catch the so-called murderer,

22
00:02:38,710 --> 00:02:43,750
wouldn't that be the greatest contempt
for the law and justice?

23
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:48,070
Wouldn't that be
the greatest perversion of the law?

24
00:02:58,960 --> 00:03:00,150
Lord Yan.

25
00:03:05,910 --> 00:03:06,840
Lord Yan,

26
00:03:07,430 --> 00:03:10,800
you want to redress the injustice
for Qingyuan's birth mother.

27
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:13,260
Your sincerity
is clear to heaven and earth.

28
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:14,820
Since that is the case,

29
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:17,660
we will certainly help you achieve this.

30
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,430
From tomorrow,

31
00:03:19,750 --> 00:03:23,210
the Xie Residence will clarify
the rumors about Fourth Madam,

32
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:26,560
and never let her suffer
any grievance again.

33
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:30,800
However, the matter concerning
Qingyuan's birth mother

34
00:03:31,190 --> 00:03:33,310
happened many years ago.

35
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:35,910
It wouldn’t be appropriate
to make a big deal out of it.

36
00:03:35,910 --> 00:03:37,910
As for the real murderer back then,

37
00:03:38,150 --> 00:03:41,310
we will certainly
investigate it to the end.

38
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:43,030
I hope Lord Yan

39
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:45,190
can give us a few more days.

40
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:46,800
Is that possible?

41
00:03:53,310 --> 00:03:54,070
Alright.

42
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:56,910
I believe Old Madam Xie

43
00:03:58,190 --> 00:03:59,360
will do as she says.

44
00:04:05,260 --> 00:04:06,570
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

45
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:08,940
Your Lordship.

46
00:04:13,240 --> 00:04:15,400
Mei Yinghua pushed all the blame

47
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:16,950
onto Chuntai.

48
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:18,800
Even with Cui'er as a witness,

49
00:04:19,269 --> 00:04:20,950
as long as she refuses to admit it,

50
00:04:20,950 --> 00:04:23,000
I won't be able to convict her
before the Master

51
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:24,000
and Grandmother.

52
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:28,920
The path you chose for yourself is one

53
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:31,270
you should walk down
with undivided resolve.

54
00:04:31,270 --> 00:04:32,600
If there's any problem,

55
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:34,320
I will always have your back.

56
00:04:34,510 --> 00:04:35,480
No matter when,

57
00:04:36,150 --> 00:04:37,120
no matter what.

58
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:45,700
Ancestors of the Xie family,
please protect me.

59
00:04:47,430 --> 00:04:48,270
Protect me.

60
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:49,830
Protect me.

61
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:51,430
Protect us,

62
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:53,310
ancestors.

63
00:04:58,830 --> 00:05:04,070
[Harmony Among Kin]

64
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:11,830
Second Madam.

65
00:05:12,750 --> 00:05:14,430
The Bodhisattva will not protect

66
00:05:14,430 --> 00:05:16,290
those with guilt in their hearts.

67
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,570
What are you doing here?

68
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:21,870
I came to ask,

69
00:05:22,950 --> 00:05:24,390
since you keep saying

70
00:05:24,390 --> 00:05:26,250
you never harmed my birth mother,

71
00:05:26,630 --> 00:05:29,240
can you swear to it
in front of the ancestors?

72
00:05:27,100 --> 00:05:29,410
[Spirit Tablet of the Late Ancestors
of the Xie Family]

73
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:33,580
Why should I listen to you?

74
00:05:33,950 --> 00:05:35,630
Because Yan Rui listens to me.

75
00:05:36,390 --> 00:05:38,650
Second Madam, you should know very well.

76
00:05:38,920 --> 00:05:42,040
If Lord Yan insists on
putting you in prison,

77
00:05:42,310 --> 00:05:44,120
neither Father nor Grandmother

78
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:45,920
would hesitate to hand you over

79
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:47,450
for the Xie family's peace.

80
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:53,270
Do I look like I'm afraid of you?

81
00:05:53,270 --> 00:05:55,470
Our Mei family also holds a noble title.

82
00:05:55,950 --> 00:05:57,000
So what?

83
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:59,960
Even Father has to stay on
Lord Yan's good side.

84
00:06:00,270 --> 00:06:02,600
Can the mere Mei family save you?

85
00:06:05,680 --> 00:06:07,080
No, let me put it this way.

86
00:06:08,630 --> 00:06:10,560
Is a concubine's married daughter

87
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:13,920
worth being saved by the Mei family?

88
00:06:16,310 --> 00:06:17,240
What do you want?

89
00:06:17,430 --> 00:06:19,230
I want to hear you tell the truth.

90
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:21,240
If you swear to God

91
00:06:21,240 --> 00:06:22,830
that you've never harmed my mother,

92
00:06:22,830 --> 00:06:25,300
I will immediately
have Yan Rui close this case.

93
00:06:25,300 --> 00:06:26,240
But,

94
00:06:30,860 --> 00:06:32,180
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

95
00:06:37,190 --> 00:06:38,600
if you break your vow,

96
00:06:39,310 --> 00:06:40,909
your son, your pride and joy,

97
00:06:41,240 --> 00:06:42,720
will be struck by lightning

98
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:44,120
and die a horrible death!

99
00:06:44,150 --> 00:06:45,240
You just want me to swear.

100
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:46,840
Why involve my son Zhenglun?

101
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:48,150
What?

102
00:06:48,510 --> 00:06:50,170
Are you afraid, Second Madam?

103
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:54,750
That's fine.

104
00:06:54,870 --> 00:06:55,920
I'll go tell Yan Rui right now...

105
00:06:54,900 --> 00:06:56,140
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

106
00:07:08,570 --> 00:07:10,870
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

107
00:07:16,310 --> 00:07:17,680
I, Mei Yinghua, swear,

108
00:07:18,240 --> 00:07:20,840
I'd never harmed
Fourth Madam and Fifth Madam.

109
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:22,710
If I'm lying,

110
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:24,480
may my son Zhenglun be struck by lightning

111
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:25,880
and die a horrible death!

112
00:07:30,850 --> 00:07:31,940
[Spirit Tablet of the Late Ancestors
of the Xie Family]

113
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:35,510
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

114
00:07:39,770 --> 00:07:42,090
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

115
00:07:40,150 --> 00:07:41,830
Zhenglun! Zhenglun!

116
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:43,000
Zhenglun!

117
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,430
Zhenglun, wake up!

118
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:45,860
Zhenglun, wake up!

119
00:07:46,070 --> 00:07:46,830
A doctor.

120
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:48,190
Get a doctor quickly!

121
00:07:48,190 --> 00:07:49,600
Why are you just standing there?

122
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:49,970
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

123
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:50,870
Zhenglun!

124
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:52,750
Zhenglun!

125
00:07:53,870 --> 00:07:54,720
Zhenglun...

126
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,510
This is karma.

127
00:07:59,150 --> 00:08:00,150
He can't be saved.

128
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:02,850
Who was it that just swore a deadly vow?

129
00:08:03,720 --> 00:08:04,390
Zhenglun!

130
00:08:05,070 --> 00:08:05,800
Zhenglun!

131
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:11,800
Oh, God...

132
00:08:11,900 --> 00:08:20,260
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

133
00:08:12,560 --> 00:08:15,510
It's all my fault.

134
00:08:16,950 --> 00:08:18,360
Zhenglun!

135
00:08:20,390 --> 00:08:21,560
I did it.

136
00:08:21,870 --> 00:08:23,000
I did it all.

137
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:25,480
Please save my child.

138
00:08:26,390 --> 00:08:28,390
Get a doctor to save my child.

139
00:08:35,150 --> 00:08:36,080
I think

140
00:08:37,150 --> 00:08:38,390
we need to give her

141
00:08:38,750 --> 00:08:40,270
irrefutable proof.

142
00:08:42,750 --> 00:08:44,690
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

143
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,000
Qingyuan.

144
00:08:48,670 --> 00:08:49,800
You wanted to see me?

145
00:09:14,200 --> 00:09:14,720
Mother.

146
00:09:15,870 --> 00:09:18,790
Qingyuan said you were guilty,
but I didn't believe it.

147
00:09:18,790 --> 00:09:20,320
I wanted to clear your name.

148
00:09:22,120 --> 00:09:22,870
But why?

149
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:26,000
Why did you do such a vicious thing?

150
00:09:27,670 --> 00:09:28,600
Son.

151
00:09:34,630 --> 00:09:35,230
Qingyuan.

152
00:09:35,750 --> 00:09:36,870
We have wronged you

153
00:09:37,150 --> 00:09:38,150
and Fourth Madam.

154
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:41,080
You bitch!

155
00:09:40,910 --> 00:09:42,300
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

156
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:42,390
How dare you set me up!

157
00:09:42,390 --> 00:09:43,200
Mother.

158
00:09:44,200 --> 00:09:44,870
Mother.

159
00:09:45,030 --> 00:09:46,760
We can't keep making mistakes.

160
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:52,200
Father.

161
00:09:52,390 --> 00:09:53,440
My mother has acknowledged her mistake.

162
00:09:53,440 --> 00:09:54,870
Since things have come to this,

163
00:09:54,870 --> 00:09:56,400
I will no longer defend her.

164
00:09:56,630 --> 00:10:00,160
I only ask that she spend
the rest of her life with the Xie family.

165
00:10:01,790 --> 00:10:02,440
Father.

166
00:10:04,670 --> 00:10:05,320
Father.

167
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:08,080
Zhenglun,

168
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,250
you may leave first.

169
00:10:10,750 --> 00:10:11,680
Grandmother...

170
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:13,210
Be a good boy.

171
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:16,290
Go change your clothes.

172
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:37,910
Zhenglun.

173
00:10:50,500 --> 00:10:56,550
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

174
00:10:51,790 --> 00:10:52,750
Mei Yinghua,

175
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:56,870
you framed my mother

176
00:10:56,580 --> 00:11:02,620
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

177
00:10:58,720 --> 00:11:00,720
and made her bear a disgraceful name

178
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:02,720
so she'd leave the residence voluntarily.

179
00:11:02,720 --> 00:11:08,010
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

180
00:11:04,670 --> 00:11:06,720
You even wanted to drive us

181
00:11:07,440 --> 00:11:08,790
both to our deaths.

182
00:11:08,070 --> 00:11:14,130
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

183
00:11:11,960 --> 00:11:13,120
You really should

184
00:11:14,030 --> 00:11:15,790
pay for my mother's life!

185
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:20,390
♪ Pear blossoms drift through the courtyard,
fluttering like snowflakes in a song ♪

186
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:20,000
That's an accusation.

187
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:22,030
After Jin Chunqing left the Xie Residence,

188
00:11:20,420 --> 00:11:26,680
♪ Singing the silence of love and hate ♪

189
00:11:22,030 --> 00:11:24,000
I had no idea where she went.

190
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:26,320
How can you pin this on me?

191
00:11:26,780 --> 00:11:33,070
♪  Which moment is hypothetical,
and which is a real choice? ♪

192
00:11:33,090 --> 00:11:38,990
♪ Who is drifting aimlessly in the wind? ♪

193
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:34,600
Whether you did it or not,

194
00:11:35,360 --> 00:11:36,890
you know best in your heart.

195
00:11:39,010 --> 00:11:45,180
♪ I wonder why joy is always
so scarce in this world ♪

196
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:51,300
♪ I wonder, is that tear a loss or a gain? ♪

197
00:11:45,510 --> 00:11:46,440
Qingyuan,

198
00:11:47,270 --> 00:11:50,360
are you sure Concubine Mei killed her?

199
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:57,540
♪ Two souls trapped on the opposite banks
of life and death ♪

200
00:11:57,510 --> 00:11:58,270
Yes,

201
00:11:57,560 --> 00:12:03,240
♪ May you and I overcome karma's bonds ♪

202
00:11:59,120 --> 00:11:59,870
I'm sure.

203
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:04,480
9 years ago,

204
00:12:05,550 --> 00:12:07,750
she started a fire at my house.

205
00:12:12,150 --> 00:12:12,910
My mother

206
00:12:14,200 --> 00:12:16,150
died in that fire.

207
00:12:17,150 --> 00:12:19,200
Nonsense. I didn't kill anyone!

208
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:19,840
Master!

209
00:12:22,750 --> 00:12:23,840
I believe

210
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:26,860
Fourth Lady and Cui'er
are telling the truth.

211
00:12:27,030 --> 00:12:28,240
You and Fourth Madam

212
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:30,000
were once deeply in love.

213
00:12:30,030 --> 00:12:31,000
At this point,

214
00:12:31,510 --> 00:12:32,790
do you still have the heart

215
00:12:32,790 --> 00:12:34,520
to let her die with a grievance?

216
00:12:37,600 --> 00:12:39,120
Please look into this, Master.

217
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:39,840
You bitch!

218
00:12:39,840 --> 00:12:40,770
Mother! Mother!

219
00:12:40,770 --> 00:12:42,120
-How dare you frame me!
-Mother! Mother!

220
00:12:42,120 --> 00:12:44,000
-Mother! Mother!
-Enough!

221
00:12:59,140 --> 00:13:01,490
[Harmony Among Kin]

222
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:03,120
I admit,

223
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:11,000
I resented Fifth Madam
for being so favored

224
00:13:12,120 --> 00:13:13,870
and overbearing.

225
00:13:14,960 --> 00:13:16,840
So I poisoned her!

226
00:13:23,510 --> 00:13:26,150
But I only gave her abortion pills.

227
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:28,510
I didn't want her dead!

228
00:13:29,150 --> 00:13:31,120
I framed Fourth Madam

229
00:13:31,910 --> 00:13:33,630
because I just wanted to drive her
out of the residence.

230
00:13:33,630 --> 00:13:35,240
I really didn't kill anyone.

231
00:13:35,240 --> 00:13:37,700
I don't know what happened later.

232
00:13:37,910 --> 00:13:39,720
All this talk about murder and arson

233
00:13:39,720 --> 00:13:41,390
is pure nonsense!

234
00:13:39,810 --> 00:13:41,350
[Harmony Among Kin]

235
00:13:41,390 --> 00:13:42,390
Concubine Mei.

236
00:13:44,790 --> 00:13:46,750
I only care about one thing.

237
00:13:47,080 --> 00:13:50,120
You finally admitted it.

238
00:13:50,960 --> 00:13:52,320
You poisoned her

239
00:13:55,870 --> 00:13:57,360
with your own hands,

240
00:14:00,790 --> 00:14:01,480
didn't you?

241
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:20,150
Master,

242
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:22,960
please believe me.

243
00:14:23,750 --> 00:14:25,600
I didn't kill anyone.

244
00:14:29,550 --> 00:14:30,360
Father.

245
00:14:31,670 --> 00:14:32,390
Father.

246
00:14:32,600 --> 00:14:34,360
It's been over a decade.

247
00:14:34,910 --> 00:14:36,620
Even if you kill my mother now,

248
00:14:36,650 --> 00:14:38,600
Fourth Madam and Fifth Madam
won't come back to life.

249
00:14:38,600 --> 00:14:39,150
Father,

250
00:14:39,440 --> 00:14:40,770
please spare my mother.

251
00:14:46,670 --> 00:14:48,480
Listen to me, everyone.

252
00:14:50,630 --> 00:14:52,080
From today on,

253
00:14:52,480 --> 00:14:58,290
[Harmony Among Kin]

254
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:58,030
Zhengjun

255
00:15:00,150 --> 00:15:01,840
is no longer your mother.

256
00:15:07,030 --> 00:15:07,960
Father!

257
00:15:08,480 --> 00:15:09,030
Father!

258
00:15:12,120 --> 00:15:12,920
Grandmother.

259
00:15:13,080 --> 00:15:13,880
Grandmother.

260
00:15:13,910 --> 00:15:15,000
I beg of you.

261
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:16,750
Please help me persuade my father.

262
00:15:16,750 --> 00:15:17,480
Okay?

263
00:15:17,840 --> 00:15:19,550
I will take responsibility
for Mother's crimes.

264
00:15:19,550 --> 00:15:21,270
I will accept any beating or punishment.

265
00:15:21,270 --> 00:15:22,600
I beg you, Grandmother.

266
00:15:29,030 --> 00:15:31,480
Second Madam is your concubine.

267
00:15:32,240 --> 00:15:33,720
You make the decision.

268
00:15:53,120 --> 00:15:55,380
[Xie Clan Ancestral Hall]

269
00:16:12,240 --> 00:16:14,100
Fifty Strokes of the Family Cane.

270
00:16:18,320 --> 00:16:20,250
Whether she survives is up to fate.

271
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:30,600
Qingyuan

272
00:16:31,030 --> 00:16:32,270
pays her respects to Grandmother

273
00:16:32,270 --> 00:16:32,930
and Mother.

274
00:16:34,320 --> 00:16:35,120
How is it?

275
00:16:36,320 --> 00:16:38,150
How are things

276
00:16:38,150 --> 00:16:39,610
over at Liuhua Courtyard?

277
00:16:39,630 --> 00:16:40,890
To answer you, Mother,

278
00:16:41,320 --> 00:16:43,240
Second Madam is still breathing.

279
00:16:43,550 --> 00:16:44,910
Second Young Master pulled some strings.

280
00:16:44,910 --> 00:16:46,570
They didn't beat her to death.

281
00:16:48,510 --> 00:16:50,360
Amitabha.

282
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:52,360
Even so,

283
00:16:52,790 --> 00:16:53,870
have the servants

284
00:16:54,030 --> 00:16:55,960
send her back to Liuhua Courtyard first.

285
00:16:55,960 --> 00:16:57,960
Pick an inconspicuous day later

286
00:16:58,440 --> 00:17:00,510
and send her away to the farmstead.

287
00:17:07,240 --> 00:17:08,349
This time,

288
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:11,800
the Xie Residence
really owes you and your mother.

289
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:13,640
After some time,

290
00:17:14,240 --> 00:17:17,160
we'll invite your mother's spirit tablet
into the Xie Residence

291
00:17:17,160 --> 00:17:19,290
and enshrine it in the ancestral hall.

292
00:17:23,240 --> 00:17:24,839
I appreciate your kindness,

293
00:17:24,960 --> 00:17:26,240
Grandmother.

294
00:17:26,920 --> 00:17:29,110
But my mother was wrongly accused.

295
00:17:29,400 --> 00:17:32,510
It might be inappropriate
to enshrine her in the ancestral hall now.

296
00:17:32,510 --> 00:17:35,480
Danyue Pavilion
is my mother's former residence.

297
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:37,510
I'm used to living there too.

298
00:17:37,510 --> 00:17:40,070
I hope you will allow me

299
00:17:40,240 --> 00:17:43,100
to enshrine my mother's tablet
in Danyue Pavilion.

300
00:17:43,240 --> 00:17:46,370
It will be convenient for me
to pay respects frequently.

301
00:17:47,310 --> 00:17:48,270
Fine.

302
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:50,590
As you wish.

303
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:54,600
Thank you, Grandmother.

304
00:17:56,550 --> 00:17:57,750
I know that

305
00:17:58,440 --> 00:17:59,840
recently, the residence

306
00:18:00,510 --> 00:18:02,440
has had much trouble because of me.

307
00:18:02,590 --> 00:18:04,070
But as my mother's child,

308
00:18:04,680 --> 00:18:06,400
how could I just sit back and watch

309
00:18:06,400 --> 00:18:08,200
when my mother was wronged?

310
00:18:08,640 --> 00:18:10,440
As for those who committed evil,

311
00:18:10,960 --> 00:18:11,830
I

312
00:18:12,200 --> 00:18:14,160
will definitely not let them off easily.

313
00:18:14,160 --> 00:18:16,000
But I understand clearly,

314
00:18:16,270 --> 00:18:17,600
and I'm deeply grateful

315
00:18:17,750 --> 00:18:18,790
for the tolerance

316
00:18:19,160 --> 00:18:20,270
that you and Mother

317
00:18:20,920 --> 00:18:23,310
have shown me.

318
00:18:25,750 --> 00:18:30,030
Since you have achieved
your goal this time,

319
00:18:30,590 --> 00:18:31,960
in the days to come,

320
00:18:32,830 --> 00:18:35,270
I hope you can live peacefully

321
00:18:36,510 --> 00:18:38,240
and not cause any more trouble.

322
00:18:40,640 --> 00:18:41,640
Qingyuan,

323
00:18:43,550 --> 00:18:45,310
the herbal shop business

324
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:47,520
will still be managed by you.

325
00:18:48,510 --> 00:18:50,070
Just as the Old Madam said,

326
00:18:51,200 --> 00:18:52,730
your birth mother's matter

327
00:18:52,960 --> 00:18:54,690
has been settled as you wished.

328
00:18:54,750 --> 00:18:57,240
Cultivate your character in the future

329
00:18:57,920 --> 00:18:59,580
and treat others generously.

330
00:19:00,160 --> 00:19:01,020
Remember that.

331
00:19:02,550 --> 00:19:04,590
I will keep your teachings in mind.

332
00:19:18,960 --> 00:19:19,590
Mother.

333
00:19:20,640 --> 00:19:22,920
Mei Yinghua has confessed her crimes.

334
00:19:23,590 --> 00:19:24,880
From now on,

335
00:19:26,240 --> 00:19:27,310
no one in this world

336
00:19:27,570 --> 00:19:30,240
[Memorial Tablet of Lady Jin,
Concubine of Lord Xie]

337
00:19:27,830 --> 00:19:30,090
will call you a murderous villain again.

338
00:19:30,640 --> 00:19:31,750
No one

339
00:19:32,830 --> 00:19:34,610
will ever hurt you like this again.

340
00:19:34,610 --> 00:19:36,720
[Memorial Tablet of Lady Jin,
Concubine of Lord Xie]

341
00:19:57,960 --> 00:19:58,680
Father.

342
00:19:59,440 --> 00:20:00,510
Qingyuan.

343
00:20:02,720 --> 00:20:06,400
I am deeply ashamed of making you

344
00:20:07,750 --> 00:20:10,880
and your mother suffer this injustice
for so many years.

345
00:20:15,030 --> 00:20:16,160
It's all in the past.

346
00:20:17,310 --> 00:20:18,480
In the past,

347
00:20:19,790 --> 00:20:20,920
you were kept

348
00:20:21,750 --> 00:20:23,280
in the dark by Second Madam.

349
00:20:42,650 --> 00:20:44,840
[Memorial Tablet of Lady Jin,
Concubine of Lord Xie]

350
00:20:51,790 --> 00:20:52,680
Chunqing.

351
00:21:05,030 --> 00:21:05,880
Mother,

352
00:21:07,880 --> 00:21:09,200
are you seeing this?

353
00:21:12,640 --> 00:21:14,040
Father is here to see you.

354
00:21:17,870 --> 00:21:21,390
[Danyue Pavilion]

355
00:21:18,240 --> 00:21:20,960
Seeing Zhenglun today

356
00:21:21,960 --> 00:21:24,070
reminds me of my younger self.

357
00:21:24,830 --> 00:21:26,880
He was passionate and impulsive.

358
00:21:28,720 --> 00:21:30,110
When I was young,

359
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:33,400
I wanted to pierce the sky.

360
00:21:36,830 --> 00:21:37,920
But eventually,

361
00:21:39,400 --> 00:21:42,790
I had to submit to my family name,
my clan,

362
00:21:43,720 --> 00:21:45,200
rules, and etiquette.

363
00:21:47,550 --> 00:21:48,590
Qingyuan.

364
00:21:49,680 --> 00:21:50,720
Concubine Mei

365
00:21:50,790 --> 00:21:53,790
has paid the price for her actions.

366
00:21:55,110 --> 00:21:57,000
Let it all be in the past.

367
00:21:57,680 --> 00:21:59,030
From now on,

368
00:21:59,640 --> 00:22:01,100
our family will live well.

369
00:22:02,240 --> 00:22:04,880
I must make up for what I owe you.

370
00:22:07,110 --> 00:22:08,070
Father.

371
00:22:09,880 --> 00:22:11,410
Have you ever occasionally

372
00:22:11,590 --> 00:22:13,120
thought of my birth mother?

373
00:22:16,680 --> 00:22:17,440
Of course.

374
00:22:22,510 --> 00:22:24,910
Not a day goes by without me
thinking of her.

375
00:22:29,400 --> 00:22:32,330
Mother is from
a well-matched, prestigious family.

376
00:22:32,750 --> 00:22:33,880
Marrying her

377
00:22:34,790 --> 00:22:36,590
helped you advance in the court.

378
00:22:36,960 --> 00:22:39,160
Second Madam is from a merchant family,

379
00:22:39,350 --> 00:22:41,030
which can help

380
00:22:42,030 --> 00:22:43,560
the Xie family's business.

381
00:22:44,030 --> 00:22:46,160
Third Madam is from a scholarly family,

382
00:22:46,160 --> 00:22:47,510
which can elevate

383
00:22:48,030 --> 00:22:49,960
your reputation

384
00:22:50,200 --> 00:22:51,440
among scholars.

385
00:22:52,480 --> 00:22:54,610
My birth mother was of humble origins.

386
00:22:56,880 --> 00:22:58,810
She had no prestigious background

387
00:22:59,270 --> 00:23:01,130
and couldn't help the Xie family.

388
00:23:01,590 --> 00:23:03,070
So why do you say that

389
00:23:03,750 --> 00:23:05,270
she was the only wife

390
00:23:05,960 --> 00:23:07,270
in your heart?

391
00:23:10,110 --> 00:23:11,370
You don't understand.

392
00:23:20,230 --> 00:23:22,850
[Danyue Pavilion]

393
00:23:27,030 --> 00:23:28,480
Everything I do

394
00:23:28,480 --> 00:23:29,960
is for this family.

395
00:23:33,400 --> 00:23:34,270
Qingyuan.

396
00:23:35,590 --> 00:23:36,790
You are still young.

397
00:23:37,160 --> 00:23:39,200
When you reach my age,

398
00:23:39,200 --> 00:23:40,880
perhaps you will understand.

399
00:23:41,400 --> 00:23:43,960
Many things in life

400
00:23:43,960 --> 00:23:45,310
are hard to balance.

401
00:23:45,830 --> 00:23:48,480
I had to be the pillar of the Xie family

402
00:23:50,640 --> 00:23:52,750
while not failing the woman I love.

403
00:23:54,440 --> 00:23:55,590
It was hard.

404
00:23:56,720 --> 00:23:59,070
To be the pillar of the Xie family,

405
00:23:59,590 --> 00:24:02,440
everything must be
for the sake of the family.

406
00:24:03,200 --> 00:24:06,830
The firmer the foundation, the better.

407
00:24:07,200 --> 00:24:09,640
The taller the tower, the better.

408
00:24:10,200 --> 00:24:15,960
Even if it means sacrificing my own love

409
00:24:16,790 --> 00:24:19,110
or even my life.

410
00:24:21,240 --> 00:24:23,590
How can I care about anything else?

411
00:24:25,110 --> 00:24:26,510
As for myself,

412
00:24:27,480 --> 00:24:29,750
when have I ever had my own life?

413
00:24:31,680 --> 00:24:33,270
Chunqing has passed away.

414
00:24:34,830 --> 00:24:36,760
True love will never come by again.

415
00:24:38,510 --> 00:24:40,510
I have failed your birth mother,

416
00:24:42,270 --> 00:24:45,590
and I fear I can never make it up to her.

417
00:24:56,830 --> 00:24:57,880
Qingyuan.

418
00:24:59,750 --> 00:25:01,830
If your birth mother knew about this,

419
00:25:02,550 --> 00:25:03,400
now,

420
00:25:04,310 --> 00:25:05,830
she would only want one thing,

421
00:25:05,830 --> 00:25:07,430
and that is for you to be well.

422
00:25:09,200 --> 00:25:10,260
Do you understand?

423
00:25:20,510 --> 00:25:21,400
Father.

424
00:25:22,350 --> 00:25:23,480
I understand.

425
00:25:24,000 --> 00:25:25,160
From now on,

426
00:25:26,270 --> 00:25:28,030
I will be a good daughter

427
00:25:28,130 --> 00:25:31,280
[Danyue Pavilion]

428
00:25:28,350 --> 00:25:31,310
and won't make you suffer
and feel guilty anymore.

429
00:25:31,440 --> 00:25:32,700
You don't understand!

430
00:25:33,400 --> 00:25:35,070
I don't want you to do those.

431
00:25:36,030 --> 00:25:37,240
I only hope

432
00:25:37,590 --> 00:25:38,960
you do one thing.

433
00:25:39,440 --> 00:25:41,000
That is, from now on,

434
00:25:42,030 --> 00:25:43,400
be safe, healthy,

435
00:25:45,110 --> 00:25:46,200
and carefree.

436
00:25:53,030 --> 00:25:54,350
Rest early.

437
00:26:07,000 --> 00:26:09,800
You value the reputation
of the Xie family so much.

438
00:26:10,110 --> 00:26:11,310
For this reputation,

439
00:26:11,880 --> 00:26:14,880
you didn't hesitate to kill
my mother with your own hands.

440
00:26:14,880 --> 00:26:16,680
Then I must topple this mountain

441
00:26:16,920 --> 00:26:18,750
you built with your own hands

442
00:26:19,790 --> 00:26:21,270
right in front of you.

443
00:26:35,440 --> 00:26:36,240
What's wrong?

444
00:26:36,680 --> 00:26:37,790
Aren't you happy

445
00:26:38,310 --> 00:26:39,110
that I'm back?

446
00:26:41,830 --> 00:26:43,090
Wei Changyan escaped.

447
00:26:44,830 --> 00:26:46,640
I searched for hundreds of miles,

448
00:26:46,640 --> 00:26:48,240
but still couldn't find him.

449
00:26:50,680 --> 00:26:52,610
You don't need to worry about this.

450
00:26:52,680 --> 00:26:54,340
Everything is under control.

451
00:26:54,590 --> 00:26:55,790
The bait we threw out

452
00:26:56,640 --> 00:26:58,440
might catch an even bigger fish.

453
00:26:58,880 --> 00:27:00,440
I don't want any big fish!

454
00:27:01,310 --> 00:27:03,000
I want Wei Changyan dead.

455
00:27:03,510 --> 00:27:04,510
I want him to pay with his life

456
00:27:04,510 --> 00:27:06,510
for the 72 deaths of our Shen family!

457
00:27:18,590 --> 00:27:19,830
I promise you.

458
00:27:20,830 --> 00:27:21,790
Wei Changyan

459
00:27:24,070 --> 00:27:25,590
will only die by my hands.

460
00:27:27,200 --> 00:27:29,800
And I won't let the people
behind him and Xie Shu

461
00:27:30,640 --> 00:27:31,790
off either.

462
00:27:51,310 --> 00:27:52,350
Zhenglun.

463
00:27:55,400 --> 00:27:58,000
Although your birth mother
made a big mistake,

464
00:27:58,640 --> 00:27:59,880
I know

465
00:28:00,480 --> 00:28:02,030
you are a good child.

466
00:28:04,960 --> 00:28:07,290
When you return to the Northern Frontier,

467
00:28:07,350 --> 00:28:08,880
take good care of yourself.

468
00:28:09,480 --> 00:28:10,440
Don't forget

469
00:28:11,350 --> 00:28:12,960
to write home often.

470
00:28:17,160 --> 00:28:17,960
Okay.

471
00:28:19,030 --> 00:28:19,830
Grandmother.

472
00:28:20,750 --> 00:28:22,210
Take care of yourself too.

473
00:28:25,400 --> 00:28:26,310
Zhenglun.

474
00:28:28,590 --> 00:28:30,750
Don't worry about things at home.

475
00:28:31,550 --> 00:28:32,640
Do your job well.

476
00:28:35,790 --> 00:28:36,440
Yes.

477
00:28:37,960 --> 00:28:38,590
Mother.

478
00:28:45,720 --> 00:28:48,830
[Guohuai Inn]

479
00:28:49,790 --> 00:28:50,520
I'm leaving.

480
00:28:52,110 --> 00:28:54,170
The family depends on you from now on.

481
00:28:57,030 --> 00:28:58,830
Take on your responsibilities.

482
00:28:59,590 --> 00:29:00,790
Don't act like a child

483
00:29:01,440 --> 00:29:02,840
and waste your life away.

484
00:29:16,440 --> 00:29:18,320
[Guohuai Inn]

485
00:29:18,680 --> 00:29:19,400
Brother!

486
00:29:19,750 --> 00:29:20,590
Take care!

487
00:29:24,750 --> 00:29:25,830
Go back.

488
00:29:33,200 --> 00:29:34,160
Brother!

489
00:29:37,000 --> 00:29:38,310
Take care!

490
00:29:42,490 --> 00:29:48,280
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

491
00:29:48,370 --> 00:29:54,090
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

492
00:29:49,620 --> 00:29:53,570
[Guohuai Inn]

493
00:29:54,510 --> 00:29:59,860
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

494
00:29:59,950 --> 00:30:05,880
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

495
00:30:06,260 --> 00:30:12,120
♪ Pear blossoms drift through the courtyard,
fluttering like snowflakes in a song ♪

496
00:30:12,280 --> 00:30:18,420
♪ Singing the silence of love and hate ♪

497
00:30:18,490 --> 00:30:24,850
♪  Which moment is hypothetical,
and which is a real choice? ♪

498
00:30:24,870 --> 00:30:30,910
♪ Who is drifting aimlessly in the wind? ♪

499
00:30:30,940 --> 00:30:36,880
♪ I wonder why joy is always
so scarce in this world ♪

500
00:30:36,900 --> 00:30:43,120
♪ I wonder, is that tear a loss or a gain? ♪

501
00:30:39,750 --> 00:30:41,210
Even now, I still remember

502
00:30:42,510 --> 00:30:44,830
how Mother sewed winter clothes
for us back then.

503
00:30:43,150 --> 00:30:49,390
♪ Two souls trapped on the opposite banks
of life and death ♪

504
00:30:46,070 --> 00:30:47,870
Although she was hot-tempered,

505
00:30:47,880 --> 00:30:49,160
to Zhengjun and me,

506
00:30:49,410 --> 00:30:55,290
♪ May you and I overcome karma's bonds ♪

507
00:30:49,720 --> 00:30:51,270
she always gave her all.

508
00:30:54,440 --> 00:30:55,480
I don't know

509
00:30:56,590 --> 00:30:58,310
why she became like this.

510
00:31:00,070 --> 00:31:01,000
Eldest Brother.

511
00:31:02,000 --> 00:31:03,680
A person's faults do not
extend to their children.

512
00:31:03,680 --> 00:31:06,270
Mei Yinghua's actions
have nothing to do with you.

513
00:31:06,270 --> 00:31:07,480
I won't blame you.

514
00:31:16,590 --> 00:31:17,510
Tomorrow,

515
00:31:18,400 --> 00:31:20,130
I will head to the battlefield.

516
00:31:21,960 --> 00:31:22,960
If this life

517
00:31:24,110 --> 00:31:25,830
can atone for half of her sins,

518
00:31:26,310 --> 00:31:28,270
it will be enough to repay our bond.

519
00:31:29,070 --> 00:31:29,790
I also hope

520
00:31:31,200 --> 00:31:32,550
it can lessen some of the

521
00:31:32,790 --> 00:31:33,990
hatred in your heart.

522
00:31:36,480 --> 00:31:37,740
Don't speak nonsense.

523
00:31:38,680 --> 00:31:39,920
You will surely

524
00:31:40,000 --> 00:31:41,400
protect the nation, achieve great things,

525
00:31:41,400 --> 00:31:42,660
and return in triumph.

526
00:31:53,680 --> 00:31:54,280
Qingyuan.

527
00:31:54,640 --> 00:31:56,550
These are freshly dried persimmons
from the Northern Frontier.

528
00:31:56,550 --> 00:31:58,410
They are soft, sticky, and sweet.

529
00:31:59,110 --> 00:32:00,570
I picked among three types

530
00:32:00,590 --> 00:32:02,400
and chose the sweetest one.

531
00:32:02,640 --> 00:32:03,440
Try it.

532
00:32:04,350 --> 00:32:05,400
If you like it,

533
00:32:05,830 --> 00:32:07,590
I'll dry a whole rack of them
when I return,

534
00:32:07,590 --> 00:32:08,680
just for us to eat.

535
00:32:10,680 --> 00:32:12,210
Thank you, Eldest Brother.

536
00:32:15,590 --> 00:32:16,990
I consider you my sister.

537
00:32:17,550 --> 00:32:18,810
Naturally, I hope that

538
00:32:19,510 --> 00:32:21,920
you can move on from your hatred soon.

539
00:32:26,110 --> 00:32:27,640
At your blooming age,

540
00:32:32,830 --> 00:32:34,200
you should smile more.

541
00:32:51,480 --> 00:32:52,510
Eldest Brother,

542
00:32:54,830 --> 00:32:56,430
I hope you return in triumph.

543
00:33:14,240 --> 00:33:15,040
Your Majesty.

544
00:33:15,510 --> 00:33:17,750
This ginseng is well-aged.

545
00:33:18,160 --> 00:33:19,890
I have tested the temperature,

546
00:33:20,200 --> 00:33:21,600
it's just right to drink.

547
00:33:21,790 --> 00:33:23,830
Eunuch Xia, you are indeed used to

548
00:33:23,830 --> 00:33:25,270
serving the late Emperor.

549
00:33:25,270 --> 00:33:26,960
The late Emperor loved this soup,

550
00:33:26,960 --> 00:33:27,920
but I do not.

551
00:33:28,830 --> 00:33:32,270
The late Emperor relied on this soup
for longevity.

552
00:33:32,830 --> 00:33:33,680
But now,

553
00:33:34,310 --> 00:33:35,790
Your Majesty is in your prime,

554
00:33:35,790 --> 00:33:37,720
which is a blessing for the nation.

555
00:33:37,830 --> 00:33:40,030
We old servants

556
00:33:40,200 --> 00:33:42,750
all wish you good health.

557
00:33:46,640 --> 00:33:48,790
Is there any news outside recently?

558
00:33:49,110 --> 00:33:51,510
I wouldn't call it news,

559
00:33:51,750 --> 00:33:53,510
but over in Hengtang,

560
00:33:53,750 --> 00:33:55,720
public resentment is boiling over.

561
00:33:55,720 --> 00:33:57,880
It's getting out of hand.

562
00:33:58,440 --> 00:33:59,880
It's strange,

563
00:34:00,160 --> 00:34:02,880
the honest censors usually

564
00:34:03,440 --> 00:34:05,240
love to petition for the people.

565
00:34:05,550 --> 00:34:07,310
But now, over in Hengtang,

566
00:34:07,750 --> 00:34:08,880
they have

567
00:34:09,590 --> 00:34:10,630
gone silent.

568
00:34:13,360 --> 00:34:15,420
Since public resentment is boiling,

569
00:34:15,440 --> 00:34:17,040
let Shen Run come back first.

570
00:34:34,020 --> 00:34:40,989
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

571
00:34:41,020 --> 00:34:47,639
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

572
00:34:47,739 --> 00:34:55,380
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

573
00:34:55,500 --> 00:35:02,800
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

574
00:35:02,940 --> 00:35:09,870
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

575
00:35:09,970 --> 00:35:19,970
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

576
00:35:20,310 --> 00:35:27,510
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

577
00:35:26,710 --> 00:35:28,280
Smells good, Miss.

578
00:35:27,530 --> 00:35:34,700
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

579
00:35:28,440 --> 00:35:29,280
What is this?

580
00:35:31,320 --> 00:35:33,320
Poria and yam strengthen the spleen,

581
00:35:33,320 --> 00:35:36,190
while gorgon nut, lotus seed,
and ginseng nourish the body.

582
00:35:34,730 --> 00:35:38,310
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

583
00:35:36,630 --> 00:35:39,880
It is perfect for those recovering
from severe injuries or illnesses.

584
00:35:38,330 --> 00:35:41,950
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

585
00:35:40,510 --> 00:35:41,440
This product

586
00:35:41,960 --> 00:35:43,190
might also sell very well.

587
00:35:41,980 --> 00:35:48,390
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

588
00:35:43,710 --> 00:35:45,070
My Lady, you're so capable.

589
00:35:45,070 --> 00:35:46,730
Whatever you do will succeed.

590
00:35:49,590 --> 00:35:50,710
Fan Zhong said

591
00:35:50,920 --> 00:35:54,520
Lord Yan would come over after
finishing his government duties.

592
00:36:04,620 --> 00:36:10,540
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

593
00:36:11,500 --> 00:36:17,860
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

594
00:36:18,280 --> 00:36:25,110
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

595
00:36:25,440 --> 00:36:32,350
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

596
00:36:32,480 --> 00:36:39,640
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

597
00:36:36,590 --> 00:36:37,590
My Lady,

598
00:36:37,800 --> 00:36:39,770
it's already the third quarter
of the You hour.

599
00:36:39,770 --> 00:36:49,750
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

600
00:36:40,590 --> 00:36:41,320
Throw this away.

601
00:36:41,320 --> 00:36:42,030
Qingyuan!

602
00:36:44,480 --> 00:36:45,280
Young Master.

603
00:36:47,840 --> 00:36:48,770
Young Master Li.

604
00:36:49,760 --> 00:36:50,360
Are you alright?

605
00:36:49,850 --> 00:36:57,410
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

606
00:36:51,800 --> 00:36:54,260
Thank you for your concern,
Young Master Li.

607
00:36:54,630 --> 00:36:55,630
Glad you're fine.

608
00:36:57,430 --> 00:37:04,740
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

609
00:37:00,150 --> 00:37:01,630
They all said you were in trouble,

610
00:37:01,630 --> 00:37:02,960
but I didn't believe it.

611
00:37:02,960 --> 00:37:04,030
I was about to come looking for you,

612
00:37:04,030 --> 00:37:05,190
but my father locked me up instead.

613
00:37:04,760 --> 00:37:08,120
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

614
00:37:05,670 --> 00:37:06,550
Soon after, I heard

615
00:37:06,550 --> 00:37:07,610
that you were fine.

616
00:37:08,110 --> 00:37:09,110
But I really missed you,

617
00:37:08,140 --> 00:37:11,850
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

618
00:37:11,400 --> 00:37:12,360
so I went on a hunger strike for days

619
00:37:11,880 --> 00:37:18,270
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

620
00:37:12,630 --> 00:37:15,030
before I finally got the chance
to come out.

621
00:37:15,150 --> 00:37:16,150
Sorry to make you worry.

622
00:37:16,150 --> 00:37:16,960
I'm fine.

623
00:37:20,880 --> 00:37:21,680
New pastries?

624
00:37:22,550 --> 00:37:24,480
My Lady made it herself.

625
00:37:23,170 --> 00:37:29,770
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

626
00:37:24,800 --> 00:37:26,280
It's called Ningxin Cake.

627
00:37:29,890 --> 00:37:36,960
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

628
00:37:37,020 --> 00:37:40,370
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

629
00:37:38,590 --> 00:37:39,670
Ningxin Cake?

630
00:37:40,400 --> 00:37:44,020
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

631
00:37:42,400 --> 00:37:44,000
Is it the 'xin' in Li Congxin?

632
00:37:44,050 --> 00:37:50,390
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

633
00:37:47,110 --> 00:37:48,000
Good name.

634
00:37:52,670 --> 00:37:55,510
It means to calm the mind
and soothe the spirit.

635
00:37:58,230 --> 00:37:59,830
It still suits me perfectly.

636
00:38:08,110 --> 00:38:10,710
Miss, you invited me
to taste the new pastries.

637
00:38:12,030 --> 00:38:14,290
Why did you give it to someone else first?

638
00:38:14,880 --> 00:38:17,410
Punctuality is a basic virtue
of a gentleman.

639
00:38:17,960 --> 00:38:19,510
Your Lordship was late yourself.

640
00:38:19,510 --> 00:38:22,070
Won't you let those
who arrived early eat first?

641
00:38:22,070 --> 00:38:24,000
I came out of a pile of dead bodies.

642
00:38:24,320 --> 00:38:26,720
I've never learned any
ways of a gentleman.

643
00:38:27,960 --> 00:38:29,840
Lord Yan, of course you're a gentleman.

644
00:38:29,840 --> 00:38:31,040
Not only a gentleman,

645
00:38:31,280 --> 00:38:33,140
but also a savior to my wife and me.

646
00:38:35,710 --> 00:38:36,970
I'll take a seat first.

647
00:38:38,760 --> 00:38:40,020
If he hadn't saved you,

648
00:38:40,070 --> 00:38:42,330
I'd have left for the afterlife with you.

649
00:38:44,030 --> 00:38:45,630
Then you can leave right now.

650
00:38:45,840 --> 00:38:47,570
I'll give you this empty title.

651
00:38:48,320 --> 00:38:50,720
A gentleman doesn't take what others love,

652
00:38:51,030 --> 00:38:51,920
but I

653
00:38:52,760 --> 00:38:55,110
like to take by force.

654
00:38:57,920 --> 00:38:58,590
Qingyuan.

655
00:39:00,000 --> 00:39:01,800
My mother has already prepared
the betrothal gifts for me.

656
00:39:01,800 --> 00:39:03,920
They will be sent to Xie Residence
in a few days.

657
00:39:03,920 --> 00:39:05,550
When the time comes, I hope Lord Yan

658
00:39:05,550 --> 00:39:06,610
will do me the honor

659
00:39:06,760 --> 00:39:08,220
of attending our wedding.

660
00:39:21,110 --> 00:39:22,040
It's so crowded.

661
00:39:22,960 --> 00:39:23,760
Young master.

662
00:39:24,070 --> 00:39:24,960
The Marquis is back.

663
00:39:24,960 --> 00:39:25,960
Let's go quickly.

664
00:39:30,960 --> 00:39:32,920
Wasn't he supposed to
entertain guests tonight?

665
00:39:32,920 --> 00:39:34,380
Why did he come back early?

666
00:39:34,480 --> 00:39:36,030
If you don't want to go back, that's fine.

667
00:39:36,030 --> 00:39:38,150
I'll just get beaten again.

668
00:39:38,550 --> 00:39:39,550
It's all up to you.

669
00:39:41,760 --> 00:39:42,360
Qingyuan.

670
00:39:43,230 --> 00:39:44,070
I have something to do today,

671
00:39:44,070 --> 00:39:45,200
so I'll leave first.

672
00:39:46,320 --> 00:39:47,190
The Ningxin Cake is delicious,

673
00:39:47,190 --> 00:39:48,790
and I like the name very much.

674
00:39:50,760 --> 00:39:52,360
I'll come again another day.

675
00:39:52,920 --> 00:39:54,030
I will return the plate.

676
00:39:54,030 --> 00:39:54,840
Keep it.

677
00:39:57,760 --> 00:39:58,360
Childish.

678
00:39:58,440 --> 00:39:59,070
Exactly.

679
00:39:59,480 --> 00:40:00,740
I'm talking about you.

680
00:40:06,320 --> 00:40:07,980
What a heartless shopkeeper.

681
00:40:10,920 --> 00:40:12,840
I was late because I was queuing

682
00:40:12,840 --> 00:40:14,300
for this osmanthus candy.

683
00:40:17,030 --> 00:40:18,800
Not only did I get nothing in return,

684
00:40:18,800 --> 00:40:20,800
but someone else reaped the benefits.

685
00:40:20,800 --> 00:40:22,530
He even stole my Ningxin Cakes.

686
00:40:23,760 --> 00:40:25,360
Then tell me, Your Lordship,

687
00:40:25,510 --> 00:40:27,240
what kind of return do you want?

688
00:40:28,230 --> 00:40:29,510
It's almost closing time.

689
00:40:29,510 --> 00:40:31,110
Accompany me for a stroll.

690
00:40:37,960 --> 00:40:39,690
How is Your Lordship's injury?

691
00:40:40,280 --> 00:40:41,630
Without you by my side,

692
00:40:41,630 --> 00:40:43,230
it's taking its time to heal.

693
00:40:43,510 --> 00:40:45,760
Lately, the wound
has been aching slightly.

694
00:40:45,760 --> 00:40:46,760
My chest

695
00:40:47,230 --> 00:40:48,880
even bled a little today.

696
00:40:49,150 --> 00:40:50,110
Why is it so serious?

697
00:40:50,110 --> 00:40:50,760
Let me see.

698
00:40:51,360 --> 00:40:52,230
Now?

699
00:40:53,590 --> 00:40:54,800
All right, come on.

700
00:40:55,630 --> 00:40:56,150
Yan Rui!

701
00:41:00,710 --> 00:41:02,440
Since you care so much about me,

702
00:41:02,480 --> 00:41:04,550
I will cherish my life in the future

703
00:41:06,800 --> 00:41:08,130
so as not to let you down.

704
00:41:14,920 --> 00:41:16,590
You are so shameless.

705
00:41:17,000 --> 00:41:18,000
You got hurt because of me.

706
00:41:18,000 --> 00:41:19,060
That's why I asked.

707
00:41:19,320 --> 00:41:20,880
Even if you fatally injure
yourself in the future,

708
00:41:20,880 --> 00:41:21,610
I won't care.

709
00:41:22,070 --> 00:41:22,760
Of course.

710
00:41:23,110 --> 00:41:25,400
You're engaged now.

711
00:41:25,590 --> 00:41:27,550
Naturally, you can't be entangled
with a notorious

712
00:41:27,550 --> 00:41:28,610
corrupt official.

713
00:41:29,110 --> 00:41:30,030
In the future,

714
00:41:30,110 --> 00:41:32,070
even if I go through hell for you,

715
00:41:32,090 --> 00:41:33,620
you won't feel sorry for me.

716
00:41:34,110 --> 00:41:35,770
Do you have to speak like this?

717
00:41:35,920 --> 00:41:36,840
Not necessarily.

718
00:41:36,840 --> 00:41:38,100
I won't say it anymore.

719
00:41:52,070 --> 00:41:53,030
Tell me,

720
00:41:55,070 --> 00:41:56,440
after Yan and Yunya

721
00:41:56,760 --> 00:41:58,090
leave Anxiang Village,

722
00:41:59,070 --> 00:42:01,280
what kind of story will they experience?

723
00:42:01,280 --> 00:42:04,070
Yan would bask in the sun

724
00:42:04,070 --> 00:42:05,200
and drink every day.

725
00:42:05,630 --> 00:42:06,400
As for Yunya,

726
00:42:06,840 --> 00:42:08,800
in these spring-like days,

727
00:42:09,320 --> 00:42:12,110
she can finally get rid of
the burdens on her shoulders

728
00:42:12,110 --> 00:42:14,710
and live the way she wants.

729
00:42:19,550 --> 00:42:20,150
Let's go.

730
00:42:20,150 --> 00:42:21,550
I'll take you somewhere.

731
00:42:28,630 --> 00:42:30,230
So this is the wish-granting tree

732
00:42:30,230 --> 00:42:31,070
you mentioned?
